WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:03.220
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.210
I’ll say it again and again!

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:07.830
I'll protect Crystal Heart!

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:13.110
I don't care whether you protect it or not.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:17.300
Can you see what I see?

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.830
What?

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:24.520
Seems you can't!  I'm a human-AI hybrid!

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.310
I can see a world that you can’t!

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:30.290
A world where I win the duel!

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.760
Don’t do it!

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.470
I captured the Earth Ignis.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:50.030
In order to collect data, 
we'll now dissect the Ignis.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.000
What?

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.160
The Ignis’s body is…

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.650
Stop!  I have free will!

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:11.670
I’m alive!

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.670
Your name…

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:21.600
Your face… I can’t… remember…

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.610
Earth…

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.440
What was that just now?

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.770
Just now…

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.060
Horrible.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.860
Emma…

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:37.080
I don’t understand.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.990
What's an Ignis?

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:03.320
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:10.110
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:17.430
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:24.000
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.750
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:37.980
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:44.690
I want to share your pain

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:22.790
Incredible, right?

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:28.800
This AI system selects the most 
precise, shortest and safest route.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.710
It is incredible.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:35.440
We'll celebrate your birthday at 
that sky restaurant next year.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.550
You're getting ahead of yourself.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.870
Huh?  An accident?

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:42.880
Avoiding accident.  Changing route.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.170
Damn!  Duck, Mom!

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.990
AIs should not control people.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:04:02.080
I won't let humanity be conquered!

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.870
Why'd you call me all the way out here?

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:17.580
Brother, what's an Ignis?

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:24.800
When I asked Emma, she told me to ask you.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:29.570
Please tell me, Brother.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.530
Are the Ignis alive?

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.520
Do they have life?

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:41.140
That depends on the definition of 
life.  But they have free will.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:46.000
They may understand the concept 
of death.  And be scared to die.

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:53.170
Does that mean SOL Technologies 
killed an Ignis?

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:59.440
If they have the desire to live - yes.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.740
Though SOL Technologies would disagree.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:08.490
Is that why you asked us to 
capture the Ignis before SOL?

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.930
That wasn’t exactly my intention.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:15.700
To be honest, I didn’t 
think they'd go this far.

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:20.370
I have free will!  I’m alive!

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:25.880
If the Ignis are alive, even 
if humans created them...

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.090
...we shouldn’t do 
whatever we want with them.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.920
Because we’re not God.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:41.800
If they're alive, maybe it's 
natural that they hate humans.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:48.230
SOL Technologies decompiled the Earth Ignis.

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:51.230
What?  Earth?

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:54.240
What does "decompiled" mean?

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:57.650
That he was disassembled?

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.270
That’s no big deal!

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:07.080
Because I resurrected from a single eyeball!

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.970
Nothing is impossible for us!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.450
You're naive.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:20.040
SOL’s technicians converted the Earth 
Ignis into source code that they could understand.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:25.130
They don’t fully understand 
the Ignis algorithm.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:28.600
So they can't convert the Ignis precisely.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:31.740
So he can’t be restored.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.710
Can’t be restored?

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.620
That's nonsense!

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:39.340
How would you know!

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:43.390
It's top secret at SOL Technologies!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.620
There’s someone at SOL 
who spies for the Hanoi.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:55.870
So that's the weird feeling I had.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:07:02.310
Why?  They didn't have to take everything!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:06.240
It's horrible!  It's heartless!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:11.180
I'm starting to hate humans too.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:17.170
You be careful.

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.500
Aoi!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:36.110
Let's play on the slide!

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:37.290
Okay!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.490
I’ll go first.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.170
Your turn, Aoi!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.220
Your turn, Miyu!

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.120
Miyu?

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.600
Where'd you go?

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:01.830
Miyu!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.830
Stop hiding and come out!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.800
Miyu!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.770
You woke up?

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.780
You should sleep a little longer.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.520
I was dreaming.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:21.480
If it was about a date with a 
handsome guy, go back to sleep.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:24.480
If you’re lucky, you 
can continue the dream.

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.460
It wasn’t like that.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:33.270
My dream was about Miyu, a girl I often 
played with in the park as a kid.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:38.170
By the way, what are you doing?

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:42.510
SOL Technologies will capture 
Aqua if I don't hurry up.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:45.120
You found Aqua’s location?

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:50.960
No.  But I have an idea with 
high likelihood of success.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:55.420
But it's risky.

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:58.420
But I have to take that risk.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.910
The disturbance I felt...

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.600
It was Earth’s final moments.

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:13.410
You wanted to talk to me?

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:17.050
The Cyberse World will soon break apart.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.810
The Cyberse World will break apart?

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:20.500
Yes.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:27.350
We must soon choose whether to 
coexist or split from the humans.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:30.080
Which side will you join?

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:31.760
I can’t tell you.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:35.750
Why?  I'll join the side you choose.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.120
That’s why.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:40.470
Are humans the Ignis' allies?

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.440
You must decide on your own.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:49.370
For which side to join... 
Determine with your own eyes.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.770
What's humanity and AI's future?

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.370
What's the truth?

00:09:56.020 --> 00:10:01.590
The humans destroyed you before 
you could see the future.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:06.560
That was unbelievably cruel.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.910
Rest in peace, Earth.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:26.730
But I still can’t reject the humans.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.710
As long as I have a fragment 
of those memories.

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:34.110
As long as I have this memory, I…

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.820
Found you, Water Ignis!

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:47.010
You can’t escape me.  Give up.

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:49.200
I was prepared for this.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.940
Your attitude is admirable.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.930
If you want to capture me, go ahead.

00:10:55.930 --> 00:11:00.490
But only if you can defeat me in a duel.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:01.940
Don’t get the wrong idea.

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:05.410
I didn’t come here to capture you.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.190
I'm here to end you!

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:14.720
It’s over.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:27.580
I told you.  You can’t escape me!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:33.540
I analyzed the Ignis algorithm 
and locked on to your existence.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.350
Even if you try to escape, it’s pointless!

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:40.360
I got you!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.580
I can’t dodge it.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:49.500
Who are you?

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:52.000
This way!  Hurry!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:55.430
Don’t interfere!

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.000
Hurry!

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.790
You can’t escape me!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.790
Oh my.  Long time no see.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.790
Ghost Girl...  Move out of the way!

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:20.390
I can’t do that.

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:24.870
Because Blue Girl is my excellent partner.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.060
Let’s begin the game!

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.170
What?

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.620
This is…

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.200
Lost track of the Ignis.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.010
Can’t detect from in here.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:52.630
Ghost Girl…  How dare you do this!

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.060
That went well.

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:07.300
I can’t find the Ignis’s location, 
but I can find Blood Shepherd’s.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:14.780
Since Go Onizuka caught his prey, he must be 
desperately searching for the neutral Aqua.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:21.020
So if we track Blood Shepherd, 
he'll lead us to Aqua.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.500
Don’t worry.  We’re your allies.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:35.700
I came here to protect 
you.  So don’t worry.

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:41.170
This is the second time you’ve saved me.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:46.420
I have the ability to distinguish 
between lies and truth.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.730
Your current appearance is fictional.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:53.030
The true you is… Aoi.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:59.360
It’s true that I’m Aoi, but 
this is the first time we've met.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:04.000
The first time you saved 
me was ten years ago.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:09.230
To be accurate, you didn’t 
save me, but a girl named Miyu.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.960
Miyu?

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.760
You remember her?

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:15.250
Yes, I remember.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:19.050
It was after I lost both 
my parents in an accident.

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:24.380
My brother and I had nowhere to live, 
so we were traveling from city to city.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.650
Let's play over there.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:36.060
While my brother was away, 
I always played by myself.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:42.270
I didn’t know how to make friends, and 
I felt that I didn’t need friends.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:45.270
But one day…

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:47.240
Hey, what’s wrong?

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:50.750
Are you waiting for someone?

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:54.160
Want to play until they show up?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.690
Miyu can swing standing up!

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:00.160
Watch!

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.160
I was in shock.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:08.520
No one's ever been this 
friendly from the start.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.870
C’mon, you try!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.360
It’s fun!

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:18.110
Okay.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.490
Wow!  You’re an expert!

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:25.040
What’s your name?

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.770
Aoi!  Aoi Zaizen!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.240
I’m-

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.350
Miyu!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:32.960
How did you know?

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.790
You said your name was Miyu earlier.

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:38.590
Oh yeah!

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:46.850
From then on, Miyu would play 
with me at the park every time.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:51.600
Hey, Miyu…

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.550
What?

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:57.280
Miyu, do you not have friends?

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:00.150
Why do you ask that?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:04.610
Because you’re always only playing with me.

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.130
I have a friend right before my eyes.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.350
Don't you, Aoi?

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:16.330
You don’t think of me as your friend?

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.510
That’s not true!

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:22.800
Phew.  You’re my friend, Aoi.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:29.270
I was happy.  She was my first friend.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:34.650
I was alone and sad, but Miyu saved me.

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:38.930
But it ended suddenly.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.650
Aoi!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.040
Miyu!

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:46.480
Aoi, I’ll show you something cool!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.420
Ta daa!

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.020
Incredible, right?

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:54.400
It's my mom’s ring!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.850
Well?

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:00.450
It’s beautiful!

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:03.000
Want to try it on?

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.600
No thanks.  It's too precious.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:09.870
C'mon!  Just try it on!

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:18.800
Oh no!  Mom will be mad!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.180
It's no good.  It won’t budge.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:34.260
Mom is going to be mad at me!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.670
Miyu?

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:40.040
Miyu, do you know where my ring is?

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.910
My most precious ring 
that your dad bought me.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:51.200
I can’t understand if 
you’re crying, Miyu.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:57.030
Stop crying and tell me, Miyu!

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.030
I’m sorry.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.230
I lost it.

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.480
What do you mean?

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:11.200
Well, I asked Miyu to bring the ring.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:17.810
When I tried to wear it on my finger, my 
hand slipped, and I dropped it in that drain.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:22.650
Miyu didn’t want to bring 
it because you'd be angry.

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:26.700
But I said you wouldn’t find out 
if you returned it right away.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.120
Mom, that’s not true-

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.170
I understand.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:34.630
I don’t know who you are, but please 
don’t play with Miyu ever again!

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:38.340
Miyu, we’re going home.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.300
Wait, Mom!  It’s not true!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:44.140
Aoi!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.370
Mom, it’s not true…

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:50.400
Miyu never came to the park again.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:57.500
Then my brother’s job ended, so I had to 
leave the city without seeing her again.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.470
You don’t have to say anything.

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:09.930
I know you’re not the type who'd force 
someone to bring a ring and wear it.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:19.110
And I haven’t seen Miyu since.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:25.110
She always remembered that you saved her.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:29.170
She promised to see you again and apologize.

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:30.710
Wait a sec!

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:33.730
How do you know her, Ignis?

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:36.500
Can it be?

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.450
Yes.

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:41.220
She's a victim of the Lost Incident.

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:44.710
And I'm the Ignis created from her.

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:48.180
Miyu is a victim of the Lost Incident?

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.670
Where's Miyu?

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:57.920
Due to the Light Ignis’s computer 
virus, she's in a deep sleep.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.550
No way!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:04.380
I attempted to remove her computer virus.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:12.380
But the Light Ignis is very strong, 
so my power couldn't do a thing.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:19.680
But then, a fragment of her 
memories flowed into me.

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:26.830
I learned she had a precious 
memory that she couldn't forget.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.790
How surprising.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:33.850
That there’s a connection 
between Aqua and Blue Girl.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:38.730
In that case, there’s only 
one thing for me to do.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:49.970
Where are they hiding?

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:52.280
Find what you’re looking for?

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:59.320
How many times must I tell 
you not to get in my way?

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.340
Why are you siding with the Ignis?

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:07.070
Well...  Due to women’s 
friendship, I guess?

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:10.550
Even I know this isn’t like me.

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:13.020
But there are exceptions.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:15.020
Are you serious?

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:17.920
I’m always serious.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.270
Then I'll show no mercy.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:23.000
We’ll compete in a PK Duel!

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:25.230
PK Duel?

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.310
Player Kill.

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:33.580
The loser has their account erased and is 
forbidden from accessing LINK VRAINS ever again!

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.570
Do you have the courage for this fight?

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:40.810
Interesting.  I’ll take 
you on in a PK Duel.

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:45.680
Blue Girl, I'll keep Blood Shepherd at bay.

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:47.660
During that time, save Aqua.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:50.800
Here I go, brother.

00:21:57.230 --> 00:22:00.820
Speed Duel!

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:23.800
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:25.240
Even denials are obvious

